1. Product Requirement Document (PRD)
Project Name: AyushJC.exe - Interactive Developer Portfolio

Objective: To showcase technical expertise through a high-performance, visually striking, and interactive web experience that converts visitors into leads (clients or recruiters).

Core Features
Interactive Landing: A "system status" hero section with high-impact typography and reactive cursor elements.

Dynamic Tech Stack: A grid-based skill showcase with hover-triggered state changes.

Work/Project Gallery: High-visibility cards for "Selected Works" with direct links to live sites and repositories.

Live Stats Integration: API-driven cards showing real-time GitHub contributions and LeetCode problem counts.

System Log/Experience: A chronological list of professional history styled as a terminal or system log.

Lead Capture: A "Let's Talk Code" contact form with validation and successful "transmission" feedback.

User Experience (UX) Goals
Micro-interactions: Every button, card, and input should react to the user (the "sell" code in your images).

Performance: Sub-1s initial load time; smooth animations even on mobile.

Accessibility: High contrast ratios (typical of Neo-Brutalism) for readability.